    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p3-p4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that\n\n$$x^n-1=(x-1)\\left(1+x+x^2+\\cdots+x^{n-1}\\right).$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Expand the right-hand side. The powers $x,x^2,\\ldots,x^{n-1}$ cancel, leaving $x^n-1$.",
          "worked": "Let $S=1+x+x^2+\\cdots+x^{n-1}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(x-1)S&=xS-S\\\\(x-1)S&=(x+x^2+\\cdots+x^n)-(1+x+\\cdots+x^{n-1})\\\\(x-1)S&=x^n-1.\\end{align*}$$\n\nEach power from $x$ to $x^{n-1}$ occurs once in each sum and cancels.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p3-p4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Deduce that for $x\\ne 1$,\n\n$$\\frac{x^n-1}{x-1}=1+x+x^2+\\cdots+x^{n-1}.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Since $x\\ne 1$, divide both sides of the identity in part (a) by $x-1$.",
          "worked": "By part (a), and since $x-1\\ne 0$,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^n-1}{x-1}&=\\frac{(x-1)(1+x+x^2+\\cdots+x^{n-1})}{x-1}\\\\\\frac{x^n-1}{x-1}&=1+x+x^2+\\cdots+x^{n-1}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 15
      },
      {
        "id": "p3-p4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Hence, simplify $1+2+2^2+\\cdots+2^{99}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2^{100}-1$",
          "worked": "Use part (b) with $x=2$ and $n=100$, since the highest exponent is $n-1=99$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}1+2+2^2+\\cdots+2^{99}&=\\frac{2^{100}-1}{2-1}\\\\1+2+2^2+\\cdots+2^{99}&=2^{100}-1.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 13
      }
    ]
  },
